20
00:00:36,492 --> 00:00:37,636
It's like an odometer:

21
00:00:37,872 --> 00:00:39,499
it tells you how far you've driven,

22
00:00:39,676 --> 00:00:41,270
not whether you got there sooner or

23
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,140
