24
00:00:42,556 --> 00:00:43,063
Ask:

25
00:00:43,134 --> 00:00:45,223
what was measured, by whom, and against

26
00:00:45,233 --> 00:00:45,716
what?

27
00:00:45,941 --> 00:00:48,655
Here, Figure gives the numbers and BMW

28
00:00:48,665 --> 00:00:49,513
repeats them:

29
00:00:49,714 --> 00:00:52,155
level B, no independent verification.

30
00:00:52,556 --> 00:00:54,761
Counting parts is not measuring results.

31
00:00:55,164 --> 00:00:56,628
Save it, and share it with someone

32
